#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="259034603" tvg-name="Ugandan MC Ecko Bazz offers up the soundtrack of his worst nightmares. Also in the programme: Guatemalan artist and poet Regina José Galindo and Afghan artist Kubra Khademi‚ Jean Lecointre‚ the Frankenstein of collage and Russian filmmaker Alexei Guerman Jr.<br/>From 05.12.2021 22:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Ecko Bazz / Political Bodies / Jean Lecointre / Alexeï German Jr - Tracks (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (05.12.2021)
