#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="641713149" tvg-name="They've always been shy and they've struggled with the feeling of a tight throat‚ blushing‚ and the deep fear of rejection that makes conversation difficult. Is this type of shy natural and normal‚ or is it social anxiety as defined in the DSM?<br/>From 30.01.2022 12:20" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",#AMINORMAL (7/8) - How to Flirt When You're Shy (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (30.01.2022)
