#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="893993034" tvg-name="Since the 1970s martial arts have been a strong source of inspiration for young black Americans‚ from early Blaxploitation films to the Black Panthers to hip-hop.<br/>From 20.09.2021 17:14" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Black Belt Matters - Kung Fu Revolution(s) (4/6) (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (20.09.2021)
