#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="458389579" tvg-name="In 1980‚ Thomas Gottschalk rapped a German version of Rappers Delight on TV. Next‚ Falco had a worldwide hit with Der Kommissar. It was the start of a German rap movement‚ and breakdancing swept over Germany. We take a nostalgic look back on the 80s and 90s cool kids of rap.<br/>From 12.11.2021 14:39" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",We Wear the Crown - 40 Years of German Rap (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (12.11.2021)
