#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="1743818232" tvg-name="For many‚ the Eurovision Song Contest is the chance for a Pan-European party. But it is also highly political‚ especially for countries in Eastern Europe. When Ukrainian group Kalush Orchestra won in 2022‚ it was a message of European solidarity against Russian aggression.<br/>From 03.05.2023 17:41" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Tracks East - Eurovision: Pop and Politics (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (03.05.2023)
