#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="1149157100" tvg-name="Exiled in Latvia since 2022‚ Russian journalist Masha Borzunova and her team are on a mission to teach Europe what Russian state media propaganda actually looks like: Sinister‚ full of contradiction and absurd.<br/>From 21.03.2023 10:56" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Tracks East - Fake News: Russian Propaganda for Beginners (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (21.03.2023)
