#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="2001669737" tvg-name="Religion has played a major role in the Russian invasion of Ukraine. Russian Orthodox Patriarch Kirill supports the war - Chechen leader Ramzan Kadyrov is sending Muslim soldiers to Ukraine in a 'holy war'. We meet the Ukrainian muslim bloggers. Artist Masha Maroz takes us on a journey through the ancestral rites of Polesia and Mihaela Drăgan invokes Roma superstitions about witches.<br/>From 31.12.2022 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Tracks East - Myth‚ Religion and War (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (31.12.2022)
