#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="475035529" tvg-name="As much of Western Europe worries about having enough gas for the winter‚ Tracks East looks at how people in Poland‚ the Czech Republic and Ukraine are facing the energy crisis and a cold winter ahead.<br/>From 22.11.2022 16:23" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Tracks East - Winter of War (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (22.11.2022)
