#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="480871683" tvg-name="Is pacifism still relevant as war rages in Ukraine? What is the point of peaceful demonstrations when the aggressor will stop at nothing? Tracks East gives a voice to the Ukrainian‚ Belarusian and Russian opposition and peace movements.<br/>From 20.04.2023 17:01" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Tracks East - Pacifism: What’s the Point? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (20.04.2023)
