#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="92141307" tvg-name="In Ukraine‚ long-distance love is the new normal. Indie pop icon Ingret Kostenko had a meteoric rise to fame until the Russian invasion forced her to flee to Germany. The man she loved was a soldier at the front and she went home regularly to see him. This separation is the inspiration for Ingret’s music.<br/>From 21.03.2023 14:25" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Tracks East - Love in Wartime (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (21.03.2023)
