#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="1199112719" tvg-name="When bombs are raining down all around‚ when freedom of expression is removed‚ does this make you laugh? Tracks East looks at how humour is used as a weapon in testing times in Belarus‚ Ukraine and Bulgaria. (And how dictators don’t have a very developed sense of humour.)<br/>From 13.12.2022 17:27" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Tracks East - Humour as a Weapon (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (13.12.2022)
