#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="1271264220" tvg-name="The family should be a haven of peace‚ a model of cohesion. But what happens to this cocoon when it is shaken by political conflict and war? Some try to reinvent the bond while others cut ties.<br/>From 20.06.2023 11:03" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Tracks East - When Politics Destroys Families (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (20.06.2023)
