#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Lives from afar" tvg-id="275464035" tvg-name="In Quebec‚ the return of spring marks the beginning of maple syrup season. For Canadians‚ this sweet nectar is more than a nutrient-rich sugar substitute‚ it is an essential part of their culture. A staple of many regional recipes‚ this amber syrup made from the sap of maple trees‚ is produced mainly in Quebec and It is now one of Canada's leading exports.<br/>From 25.09.2023 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",GEO Reportage - Canada: The Maple Syrup Country (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (25.09.2023)
