#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Planet Earth" tvg-id="1496943850" tvg-name="In 1970‚ the construction of one of Africa’s most impressive infrastructure projects began: The Tanzania-Zambia-Railway. This programme accompanies the 'Tazara' on its fifty-two-hour journey through the two countries and shows both the architectural monuments along the route and the breathtaking landscapes it passes through<br/>From 07.08.2023 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",World's Most Dangerous Railways - The Tazara: From Tanzania to Zambia (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (07.08.2023)
