#EXTINF:-1 group-title="History - 20th Century" tvg-id="323601910" tvg-name="Established by Mao Zedong in the 1940s‚ China’s concentration camp system has committed 50 million people‚ intellectuals‚ workers‚ students‚ peasants‚ to a life of hell over the last eighty years‚ with 20 million deaths. Not dissimilar to the Soviet Gulag‚ this cruel system of oppression was intended to bring about a ‘thought reform’ in the prisoners.Survivors of the Laogai system‚ now living in .....<br/>From 22.03.2023 10:40" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",China’s Concentration Camps (1/2) - Laogai: The Chinese Gulag (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (22.03.2023)
