#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - Environment" tvg-id="1829624554" tvg-name="Algae pollute our beaches and our waters. But is this dangerous nuisance also an opportunity? They can be used as a raw material to make eco-friendly plastic‚ cure diseases and are an untapped food source. We take a look at seaweed's huge potential to make the world a better place.<br/>From 09.08.2023 14:54" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Incredible Powers of Algae (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (09.08.2023)
