#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="1885856424" tvg-name="Our most powerful weapon against the covid-19 pandemic has been the little known messenger RNA technology. But researchers have been developing it for the last 20 years with the initial goal of creating a cancer vaccine.<br/>From 02.02.2022 18:35" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - Can mRNA Vaccines Cure Cancer? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (02.02.2022)
