#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="2018954510" tvg-name="A rhino weighs three tons‚ a fly weighs five milligrams‚ and an adult male weighs around 80 kg. But what is the total weight of all living things on Earth?<br/>From 27.10.2021 17:53" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",How Much Does Life Weigh? - 42: The Answer to Almost Everything (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (27.10.2021)
